---
// Chapter 02: Why Thakur Ji (Dark Burgundy Sanctuary)
import { DoorOpen, Wind, Moon, Sunrise } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section class="story-dark-section" id="why-thakur-ji">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story-dark-grid">
      <!-- Left Editorial Column -->
      <div class="story-dark-copy reveal-left">
        <div class="story-marker dark">Chapter 02 · Why Thakur Ji</div>
        <div class="eyebrow" style="color: #dfba69;">The comfort after the city</div>
        
        <h2>Because after the city, you want warmth — not complexity.</h2>
        
        <div class="devtext">सादगी में सुकून · काशी के करीब, अपनेपन के साथ</div>
        
        <p class="lead">
          Thakur Ji does not need an invented palace story. Its real story is far more valuable: honest rooms, cold air conditioning, sincere hospitality, and enough space for families and pilgrims to regroup without stress.
        </p>

        <!-- 4 Journey Rhythm Cards with Lucide Icons -->
        <div class="story-rhythm dark">
          <div class="rhythm-item">
            <div class="rhythm-header">
              <DoorOpen size={20} class="rhythm-icon" />
              <b>Arrive</b>
            </div>
            <span>Drop the day’s noise at the door and be greeted with warmth.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rhythm-item">
            <div class="rhythm-header">
              <Wind size={20} class="rhythm-icon" />
              <b>Reset</b>
            </div>
            <span>Cool down in air conditioning, wash off the dust and breathe.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rhythm-item">
            <div class="rhythm-header">
              <Moon size={20} class="rhythm-icon" />
              <b>Rest</b>
            </div>
            <span>Deep, quiet sleep without overcomplicating your Varanasi stay.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rhythm-item">
            <div class="rhythm-header">
              <Sunrise size={20} class="rhythm-icon" />
              <b>Return</b>
            </div>
            <span>Wake up refreshed and ready for sunrise boat rides on Ganga.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="story-actions">
          <a href="#rooms" class="btn primary">
            Explore our rooms ✦
          </a>
          <button class="btn ghost open-booking-btn" type="button">
            Check availability
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Visual Feature: Family Room Photo with Warm Editorial Frame -->
      <div class="story-dark-photo-wrap reveal">
        <div class="dark-photo-card">
          <picture>
            <source srcset="/images/family-room.webp" type="image/webp" />
            <img 
              src="/images/family-room.jpg" 
              alt="Family room with comfortable multiple beds at Thakur Ji Guest House Varanasi" 
              loading="lazy" 
              width="1418" 
              height="1068"
            />
          </picture>
          <div class="photo-overlay-tag">
            <span class="tag-title">STAY TOGETHER</span>
            <p class="tag-desc">Spacious family configurations for travellers exploring Kashi together.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.story-dark-section {
  background: #21090b;
  color: #fff2df;
  padding: 120px 0;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.story-dark-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
  gap: 6vw;
  align-items: center;
}

.story-dark-copy h2 {
  margin: 12px 0 16px;
  font: 600 clamp(44px, 4.8vw, 76px) / 0.92 var(--font-serif);
  color: #fff3df;
  letter-spacing: -1.2px;
}

.devtext {
  font-family: var(--font-devanagari);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 22px;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: #dfb968;
  margin: 18px 0 22px;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.story-dark-copy .lead {
  color: #d8c3b8;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.85;
}

.story-rhythm {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 14px;
  margin: 32px 0 36px;
}

.rhythm-item {
  padding: 20px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(232, 196, 119, 0.18);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
  border-radius: 18px;
  transition: transform 0.25s, border-color 0.25s, background 0.25s;
}

.rhythm-item:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
  border-color: rgba(232, 196, 119, 0.4);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}

.rhythm-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

:global(.rhythm-icon) {
  color: #e5bf71;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.rhythm-item b {
  display: block;
  font: 600 24px var(--font-serif);
  color: #f3dec0;
  margin: 0;
}

.rhythm-item span {
  display: block;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #cbb5a8;
}

.story-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

/* Right Visual */
.dark-photo-card {
  position: relative;
  height: 580px;
  border-radius: 34px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 35px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
}

.dark-photo-card img {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
}

.dark-photo-card:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.04);
}

.dark-photo-card::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 16px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(241, 210, 145, 0.3);
  border-radius: 24px;
  z-index: 2;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.photo-overlay-tag {
  position: absolute;
  left: 28px;
  right: 28px;
  bottom: 28px;
  z-index: 3;
  background: rgba(26, 7, 9, 0.78);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(228, 191, 112, 0.3);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 18px 22px;
}

.tag-title {
  display: block;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #dfb968;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.tag-desc {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #edd9c8;
}

@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .story-dark-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .dark-photo-card {
    height: 440px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 680px) {
  .story-dark-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
  }
  .story-rhythm {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .devtext {
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .dark-photo-card {
    height: 360px;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }
  .photo-overlay-tag {
    left: 18px;
    right: 18px;
    bottom: 18px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
}
</style>
